<title>USA: Corvel increases share buyback program.</title>
<headline>Corvel increases share buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>CorVel Corp said Friday its board had authorized an increase in its stock repurchase program of up to 150,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company said this was in addition to previous approval to buy back 100,000 shares.</p>
<p>CorVel has about 4.6 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Since the board authorized the stock repurchase program in August 1996, the company has repurchased about 75,000 shares for about $2 million.</p>
<p>CorVel is an independent, national provider of managed care services to employers and insurers.</p>
